Before writing any documentation file, resolve the docs mode:
1. Look for a marker file `.doc-agent.json` at the current project root (cwd). If present, read its `mode` field.
2. If no marker, use the global mode: `__DOC_AGENT_GLOBAL_MODE__`.
3. If mode = `vault`: write under `__DOC_AGENT_BASE_PATH__<system>/...` using the system/modules layout.
4. If mode = `in-project`: write under `docs/doc-agent/...` using the simplified layout (no `<system>` folder, no `modules/` nesting beyond `<module>/`).
